ies": 945, "created": 1794580584000, "id": "2121250835346694561", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/1825339287866351616/img/Hedv1C8aCyAMOKOJ.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/1825339287866351616/pl/oH3NPu48kKVIqWJr.m3u8?tag=16&v=1be", "aspectRatio": [160, 91], "heightRatio": 56, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/1825339287866351616/vid/avc1/474x270/9i9zN8kNJg6uA9a9.mp4?tag=16"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1982977751838605312/9cRqjh7Q_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Rey de los Gordos", "username": "ReyGordos"}, "content": "Un Musulm\u00e1n quiso agredir a una Rusa por no cubrirse la cara, La se\u00f1ora como buena rusa lo Nockeo de una bife", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 63669}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATodl250Z", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 13, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8939497, "raw_content": "At 9:00 am EST on Wed. **11 Nov. 2026 the original Constitutional Common Law legal framework was restored** and **the 148-year-old American Bar Association was transitioning Lawyers to practice Constitutional Common Law instead of Admiralty Law.**\r\n\r\nThere were 400,000 lawyers previously licensed under the Bar Association who were now trained to practice Constitutional Common Law. **The monopoly on legal practice has been broken, opening court representation to paralegals, legal researchers and Constitutional scholars.**\r\n\r\nA sovereign Constitutional Tribunal was actively disbarring anyone attempting to operate under the former Admiralty system. Non-compliant practitioners were being reassigned.\r\n\r\nFor over a century while under the guise of public protection, the American Bar Association operated as a **private cartel**. They controlled legal representation, set artificial entry barriers, enforced corporate legal compliance, while pledging allegiance to the UK Bar Association rather than the US Constitution.\r\n\r\nNow while courtrooms look unchanged, existing dockets were being replaced by Common Law proceedings.        ~ Judy Byington,\r\n \r\n13 Nov 2026,  W T P N  . S I T U A T I O N  .  U P D A T E", "author": "FreeFire", "created": 1794643399469, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Aambrick", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The 148-year-old American Bar Association was transitioning Lawyers to practice Constitutional Common Law instead of Admiralty Law. . .the monopoly on legal practice has been broken, opening court representation to paralegals, legal researchers and Constitutional scholars.", "last_comment_created": 1794648556859, "content": "<p>At 9:00 am EST on Wed. <strong>11 Nov. 2026 the original Constitutional Common Law legal framework was restored</strong> and <strong>the 148-year-old American Bar Association was transitioning Lawyers to practice Constitutional Common Law instead of Admiralty Law.</strong></p>\n<p>There were 400,000 lawyers previously licensed under the Bar Association who were now trained to practice Constitutional Common Law. <strong>The monopoly on legal practice has been broken, opening court representation to paralegals, legal researchers and Constitutional scholars.</strong></p>\n<p>A sovereign Constitutional Tribunal was actively disbarring anyone attempting to operate under the former Admiralty system. Non-compliant practitioners were being reassigned.</p>\n<p>For over a century while under the guise of public protection, the American Bar Association operated as a <strong>private cartel</strong>. They controlled legal representation, set artificial entry barriers, enforced corporate legal compliance, while pledging allegiance to the UK Bar Association rather than the US Constitution.</p>\n<p>Now while courtrooms look unchanged, existing dockets were being replaced by Common Law proceedings.        ~ Judy Byington,</p>\n<p>13 Nov 2026,  W T P N  . S I T U A T I O N  .  U P D A T E</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 13, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}